     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Correcting",
     "texto": [
      "A **corectură** corrects a specific error; a difference of interpretation requires explaining which proof or reasoning is being discussed."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
